{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Never Second in Rome</i> is a turn-based historical game with RPG and management elements. You take the role of a Roman centurion in the army of Julius Caesar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a Republic dominating the Mediterranean World and yet shaken by internal strife, still traumatized by the horrors of the civil war that marked the previous generation, the arrival of a new governor in your province will initiate a succession of events that will ultimately define the future of Rome and its empire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting right before the beginning of the Gallic War, you will assume command of a century in a newly raised legion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the main character, you will control the small army unit in your charge, your century.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train yourself and your century, appoint your staff and discover the most remarkable individuals at your service.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and lead your legionaries in real historical battles relying on a complex system of intertwined stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based individual combat involving not only your main character, but also the soldiers under your command.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text-based events and narrative sections with many Attribute and Skill checks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great care and attention to historical detail and accuracy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free demo available</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can download and play the free demo directly on Steam. It allows you to explore the first three chapters of the game at your own pace. I recommend trying it before you buy, it's the best way to find out whether this game is up your alley.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Armillatus - Silver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169580/19d436d25a060e596376dd8092ed8291d991de49.jpg"},{"name":"Armillatus - Gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169580/9a2575d8430c4a801a13350dc8b1b37b65eff585.jpg"},{"name":"Torquatus - Silver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169580/74080b958eee2e3b62aff5dadcb7a536d5b7e5d5.jpg"},{"name":"Torquatus - Gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169580/faea9154cda275c6f7ca955a33be35bd210bd4fa.jpg"},{"name":"Heroic Deed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169580/596c9613fb7486be8c0053f1afb57b108729ba5b.jpg"},{"name":"Trespasser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169580/e571e16c9031bcb028b7f9288564827cd0d0e1f4.jpg"},{"name":"First Man Over The Wall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169580/6750cd7bee81a5760c7c4df3f77265355e48075b.jpg"},{"name":"Ob Civem Servatum I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169580/b45044dcbe91b1310cd21cb7108fd37473c910e7.jpg"},{"name":"Following The Footsteps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169580/2f805578b31ea3b5369e737fc8c992f5011e9ffd.jpg"},{"name":"Pupil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169580/df3ab0d98220d13a92662fd3b5e7a2eceb5023fb.jpg"}],"total":45},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3169580?t=1773397498","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773397498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169580/d98859d35d76aed000f09bfd765cb338b2b69550/capsule_2