lass=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text-based events and narrative sections with many Attribute and Skill checks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great care and attention to historical detail and accuracy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free demo available</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can download and play the free demo directly on Steam. It allows you to explore the first three chapters of the game at your own pace. I recommend trying it before you buy, it's the best way to find out whether this game is up your alley.</p>","developers":["Alessandro Roberti"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169580/header.jpg?t=1773397498","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3169580/751003/149377460f63b84957aaac49c2a0e19bdceea12d/1750824375/dash_av1.mpd?t=1725451472","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3169580/751003/149377460f63b84957aaac49c2a0e19bdceea12d/1750824375/dash_h264.mpd?t=1725451472","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3169580/751003/149377460f63b84957aaac49c2a0e19bdceea12d/1750824375/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1725451472","id":257052369,"name":"Never Second in Rome - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257052369/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1725451472"}],"name":"Never Second in Rome","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recur